Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:32:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Memory.Map.open(fileHandle:) on Windows acquires the
 coordinated file lock it computes and holds it until unmap instead of storing
 no lock (swift-compositions/swift-memory-mapping#14)

---
 .../Memory Mapping/Memory.Lock.Token.swift    | 78 +++++++++----------
 Sources/Memory Mapping/Memory.Map.swift       | 27 ++++++-
 .../Memory.Map Tests.swift                    | 44 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 107 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)

